{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/8882f813de8813bde7eb3a9eacc7b72c.avif?t=1771846755\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Construction Crew</strong> gives you the freedom to take on a variety of construction jobs: from foundation work to paving highways, finishing structures, and even demolition. Every machine, from cranes to loaders, becomes a trusty sidekick as you and your crew bring projects to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.poster.avif?t=1771846755\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.webm?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.mp4?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move soil with dozers, lift beams with cranes, roll asphalt to a smooth finish, or <strong>tear down old buildings</strong> to clear space for something new. No two contracts are alike, whether working on a highway, raising a steel structure, completing foundation work, or handling demolition tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with up to four players in co-op. Operate various machines and oversee multiple tasks, collaborating in real-time to keep the project on schedule. Each member must master skills such as precision steering of dump trucks and rhythmic paving with compactors, as well as coordinating actions to ensure efficient progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.poster.avif?t=1771846755\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.webm?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.mp4?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When mistakes happen, such as a wayward asphalt line, the team works together to make quick corrections. The countdown creates engaging pressure, encouraging teamwork and skill development. Decide together how to divide jobs or compete in friendly challenges, like who can make the neatest line during the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around contracts, heavy machinery, and teamwork. With your in-game tablet, accept contracts, coordinate your company, and head to the site with your crew. Start small and watch your company grow as completed contracts unlock new equipment and prestige, driving you toward shared goals. Celebrate milestones as your single-truck outfit becomes a fleet shaping the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/df31c45bf23f1c4b8243177697b0b3ed.poster.avif?t=1771846755\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/df31c45bf23f1c4b8243177697b0b3ed.webm?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/df31c45bf23f1c4b8243177697b0b3ed.mp4?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign team roles, manage task division, and coordinate actions to maximize efficiency on every project.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse projects</strong> \u2013 Roads, highways, parking lots, foundations, building construction &amp; demolition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive machine fleet</strong> \u2013 Excavators, cranes, wheel loaders, dump trucks, rollers, dozers, asphalt pavers, striping trucks, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on building</strong> \u2013 Dig, lift, haul, pour, pave, and paint your way through complete construction jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 player co-op</strong> \u2013 Work solo or share the workload online with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Company growth</strong> \u2013 Start with basic gear, earn money, and unlock advanced vehicles and contracts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic worksites</strong> \u2013 Terrain deforms, materials behave naturally, and every machine leaves its mark.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586760?t=1771846755","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/6e1574674d9fd67814b142aad088f0279c86e0f0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771846755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/7c3d37e9e76e77432f4a19ed127c679059cd1e6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771846755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/7c3d37e9e76e77432f4a19ed127c679059cd1e6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771846755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3586780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/8882f813de8813bde7eb3a9eacc7b72c.avif?t=1771846755\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Construction Crew</strong> gives you the freedom to take on a variety of construction jobs: from foundation work to paving highways, finishing structures, and even demolition. Every machine, from cranes to loaders, becomes a trusty sidekick as you and your crew bring projects to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.poster.avif?t=1771846755\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.webm?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.mp4?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move soil with dozers, lift beams with cranes, roll asphalt to a smooth finish, or <strong>tear down old buildings</strong> to clear space for something new. No two contracts are alike, whether working on a highway, raising a steel structure, completing foundation work, or handling demolition tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with up to four players in co-op. Operate various machines and oversee multiple tasks, collaborating in real-time to keep the project on schedule. Each member must master skills such as precision steering of dump trucks and rhythmic paving with compactors, as well as coordinating actions to ensure efficient progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.poster.avif?t=1771846755\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.webm?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.mp4?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When mistakes happen, such as a wayward asphalt line, the team works together to make quick corrections. The countdown creates engaging pressure, encouraging teamwork and skill development. Decide together how to divide jobs or compete in friendly challenges, like who can make the neatest line during the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around contracts, heavy machinery, and teamwork. With your in-game tablet, accept contracts, coordinate your company, and head to the site with your crew. Start small and watch your company grow as completed contracts unlock new equipment and prestige, driving you toward shared goals. Celebrate milestones as your single-truck outfit becomes a fleet shaping the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/df31c45bf23f1c4b8243177697b0b3ed.poster.avif?t=1771846755\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/df31c45bf23f1c4b8243177697b0b3ed.webm?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/extras/df31c45bf23f1c4b8243177697b0b3ed.mp4?t=1771846755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign team roles, manage task division, and coordinate actions to maximize efficiency on every project.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse projects</strong> \u2013 Roads, highways, parking lots, foundations, building construction &amp; demolition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive machine fleet</strong> \u2013 Excavators, cranes, wheel loaders, dump trucks, rollers, dozers, asphalt pavers, striping trucks, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on building</strong> \u2013 Dig, lift, haul, pour, pave, and paint your way through complete construction jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 player co-op</strong> \u2013 Work solo or share the workload online with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Company growth</strong> \u2013 Start with basic gear, earn money, and unlock advanced vehicles and contracts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic worksites</strong> \u2013 Terrain deforms, materials behave naturally, and every machine leaves its mark.</p></li></ul>","developers":[" Ultimate Games S.A."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586760/b12131c10cbad0a338dba3e4c5eba8f962922566/header.jpg?t=1771846755","is_f